#: ../../source/docs/ros-distance-sensors.rst:32
#: dd743f6966de4817a4a25d0c7e634146
msgid ""
"By default, ArduPilot will send distance sensors message for each "
"rangefinder connected on FCU on Rover and only downward oriented (PITCH_270)"
" on Copter and Plane. Example : launch SITL and add a analog rangefinder, "
"see `SITL instruction here <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-sitl-for-"
"ardupilot-testing.html#adding-a-virtual-rangefinder>`__. Launch MAVROS with "
"default config. You should have rangefinder data in "
"/mavros/distance_sensor/rangefinder_pub."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ArduPilot 在 Rover 上对每个连接到飞控的测距仪发送距离传感器消息，在 Copter 和 Plane "
"上仅对朝下方向（PITCH_270）发送。示例：启动 SITL（软件在环仿真）并添加模拟测距仪，参见 `此处 SITL 说明 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing.html#adding-a-virtual-rangefinder>`__。以默认配置启动 MAVROS，您应在 "
"/mavros/distance_sensor/rangefinder_pub 中看到测距仪数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-distance-sensors.rst:47
#: d15549c44309419091f4616634f893ee
msgid "Send to FCU"
msgstr "发送到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-distance-sensors.rst:49
#: c7c5f23cfa7e4289b9dd192666b0468e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot support receiving rangefinder data coming from Companion Computer "
"for example. To do that, setup a MAVLink rangefinder on ArduPilot side and "
"simply set a subscriber in MAVROS plugin :"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持接收来自伴飞计算机等设备的测距仪数据。为此，在 ArduPilot 端设置 MAVLink 测距仪，并在 MAVROS "
"插件中设置订阅者："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-distance-sensors.rst:61
#: b755a7e958e94be2b9685849c510bf51
msgid ""
"Now, publish a sensor_msgs/Range message on "
"/mavros/distance_sensor/rangefinder_sub. Using a GCS, you can see data in "
"rangefinder measurements."
msgstr ""
"现在，向 /mavros/distance_sensor/rangefinder_sub 发布 sensor_msgs/Range "
"消息。使用地面站（GCS）即可查看测距仪测量数据。"

